+/***
+ *
+* 1, DCTL.SftDiscon = 1( for device soft-disconnect)
+*
+* 2. Data pin contact detect.
+*     - Set BCCR.IdpSrcEn and BCCR.RdmPdwnEn to 1.
+*     - Check BCCR.DpAttached. If BCCR.DpAttached = 1, continue next step.
